abstract: >-
  The artefact behind the paper: lanelang, a demonstration language whose values carry a
  determinism class joined over the whole dependency path, checked at every declaration,
  and discharged into backend lowering obligations, together with the checker, evaluator,
  fixtures, fuzzer, must-fail controls and Coq mechanisation.
